                    r2_community_hint:      `A third actor: cheap co-creation at scale, but un-curated it invites misuse. €0 = no community; ≥€80k = curated.`,
                    onboard_light:          `Light-touch wizard — capture 80% of the occupancy data with 20% of the friction (€350k)`,
                    onboard_mandatory:      `Mandatory full schedule before activation — clean data, but ~30% activation drop-off (€300k)`,
                    onboard_none:           `Leave onboarding as-is — no spend, no change`,
                    expect_honest:          `Honest “comfort vs savings” choice at sign-up — dampens the headline, kills the backlash (€150k)`,
