                    r3_misusespend_label:   `Budget for the misuse fix — detection, trigger redesign or reward (€k).`,
                    r3_misusespend_hint:    `Designing out or converting needs build effort; punitive enforcement is cheap but erodes trust across the base.`,
                    r3_signal_label:        `How much do you weigh the signal to the 236,000 loyal customers over the €88k recovery? (%)`,
                    r3_signal_readout:      `Protecting the loyal base over chasing the €88k:`,
                    rule_mutual:            `Mutual & easy — firm guarantees coaching + tools; customer shares a simple schedule; verified-behaviour guarantee. Easy to honour.`,
                    rule_firmheavy:         `Firm-does-everything — promise savings regardless of customer input (re-opens the over-promise)`,
                    rule_customerheavy:     `Customer-must-prove — heavy obligations and paperwork before any guarantee (high friction barrier)`,
                    rule_none:              `No explicit rule — leave the contract implicit, as today`,
