                    sum_r3_good:            `Mutual rule; misuse designed out, base protected.`,
                    sum_r3_punitive:       `Punished the whole base for the few — trust eroded.`,
                    sum_r3_weak:            `Weak rule or unmanaged misuse risk.`,
                    sum_r4_good:            `Re-engaged at-risk base; eased friction; defended redesign.`,
