                    insight_cocreated:      `Value co-created: you turned a co-destruction crisis into a redesigned journey — value rising, co-destruction down, satisfaction recovering, all within the €2.0M cap and the 30% margin floor. You fixed the interactions, not the surface.`,
                    insight_capbreach:      `You breached the €2.0M cap or the 30% margin floor. The CFO kills the plan before the next cold snap — elegant service that no one can afford is not a recovery. Let the interaction design carry the load, not more spend.`,
                    insight_destruct:       `Co-destruction is still high — value is still collapsing at one or more touchpoints. Re-examine onboarding, the coaching cadence and the co-creation rule; you left a failure point open.`,
                    insight_short:          `You improved but the recovery is fragile. Co-created value is below the target and the next cold snap could re-open the gap. Most likely you under-redesigned a touchpoint or sent the wrong signal on the misuse.`,
                    insight_trust:          `Satisfaction and trust stayed low: the base still feels the value was destroyed. Genuine recovery comes from redesigned interactions and a fair misuse response — not enforcement or a discount.`,
                    insight_designedout:    `Co-destruction is near-eliminated — you designed the misuse out and made the customer's contribution easy. That is service design within the constraint, exactly the discipline the case rewards.`,
                    insight_lasts:          `This is a recovery that lasts: value, low co-destruction and satisfaction moving together. When the next cold snap arrives, the redesigned journey holds.`,

                    hint_cap:               `You're at or over the €2.0M cap / 30% margin floor. Drop the human-agent or feature spend and let the interaction design carry the personalisation.`,
                    hint_destruct:          `Co-destruction is still high. Fix the worst touchpoint by simplifying the interaction — a light-touch wizard, honest expectations, relevant coaching — not by adding more.`,
                    hint_trust:             `Trust is dangerously low. Check your misuse response — punishing the whole base for 4,000 gamers signals distrust and spreads co-destruction. Design it out instead.`,
                    hint_behind:            `Co-created value is behind with little time left. Concentrate on the two worst touchpoints and a mutual co-creation rule the customer can easily honour.`,
                    hint_strong:            `Strong position — value up, co-destruction down, margin intact. Now sequence the recovery so it survives the cold snap in 45 days.`,

